	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process and starts with filing a copy for internal records.
Once a copy of the record is filed for internal records, you need to create a receiving report.
When the creation of the Receiving report is completed, one or more of the following paths should be executed: confirming that all documents have been changed, doubling check a three-way match, gathering the Receiving Report
After doubling a three-way match, a timely report of errors is to be made to the relevant team member.
Then one or more of the following paths should be executed: creating vouchers for the documents, stamping all documents.
The process is now complete.
"
